but it sounded like you thought you,
Alice, and me were friends before.

125
00:11:42,540 --> 00:11:43,560
Yes, I remember.

126
00:11:43,860 --> 00:11:47,317
But we only just met, so I don't
know where all that came from.

127
00:11:47,400 --> 00:11:50,812
It's like, at that moment, I
could see it as clear as day.

128
00:11:51,140 --> 00:11:52,640
You, Alice, and me.

129
00:11:53,400 --> 00:11:56,635
We were born on the same day
and grew up together here.

130
00:11:57,240 --> 00:12:00,240
We were even together the
day Alice was taken away.

131
00:12:01,560 --> 00:12:02,390
That's weird.

132
00:12:02,940 --> 00:12:07,705
By the way, when Selka was healing you,
you didn't happen to hear, like, a voice,

133
