153
00:13:44,320 --> 00:13:46,960
Alice and her family
have suffered so much.

154
00:13:47,380 --> 00:13:48,880
All because of me.

155
00:13:59,460 --> 00:14:01,140
I couldn't save her.

156
00:14:01,700 --> 00:14:03,980
I don't know why, but I couldn't.

157
00:14:04,140 --> 00:14:07,552
And for the past six years, I
never stopped regretting it.

158
00:14:11,480 --> 00:14:13,680
I want to become strong.

159
00:14:14,060 --> 00:14:16,360
So I can fight.

160
00:14:16,780 --> 00:14:19,309
So I can keep from
making the same mistake.

161
00:14:22,060 --> 00:14:24,940
So I can get back what I lost years ago.

162
00:14:25,900 --> 00:14:26,780
That's why.

163
00:14:27,740 --> 00:14:30,093
That's why I want to become a swordsman.

164
00:14:31,880 --> 00:14:33,780
Alright then, you're on!

165
00:14:34,360 --> 00:14:36,320
I'll teach you everything I know.

166
00:14:39,140 --> 00:14:41,316
The training's gonna be tough though.

167
00:14:43,780 --> 00:14:45,133
That's what I'm hoping?

168
00:14:49,460 --> 00:14:53,340
Before we start, do you remember
what your sword style is called?

169
00:14:58,220 --> 00:14:59,580
Yeah, I remember.

170
00:15:01,780 --> 00:15:03,540
It's the Aincrad style.

171
00:15:25,020 --> 00:15:27,220
All right, Eugeo, finish it.

172
00:16:12,220 --> 00:16:14,120
This is like a dream.

173
00:16:14,360 --> 00:16:16,478
I never thought this day would come.

174
00:16:17,740 --> 00:16:23,040
I didn't believe in
destiny before, but now...

175
00:16:24,180 --> 00:16:27,160
Kirito, my calling wasn't my destiny.

176
00:16:27,600 --> 00:16:31,420
For the past six years, I've
been waiting for you to come.

177
00:16:33,780 --> 00:16:35,580
Yeah, maybe you were.

178
00:16:37,220 --> 00:16:41,980
But then again, maybe I woke up
here just so I could meet you.

179
00:16:56,960 --> 00:16:58,320
Why are you here alone?

180
00:17:00,540 --> 00:17:03,893
Oh, Eugio's with your dad
somewhere, talking about stuff.

181
00:17:04,180 --> 00:17:05,420
Oh, I see.

182
00:17:05,800 --> 00:17:08,077
I'm sure he's getting
a lot of well-deserved

183
