184
00:17:11,900 --> 00:17:14,197
After all the effort he
put in, he deserves it.

185
00:17:14,280 --> 00:17:19,300
I decided to study harder so I can be as
good at the sacred arts as my sister was.

186
00:17:20,680 --> 00:17:22,840
Not so I can be like her, mind you.

187
00:17:25,480 --> 00:17:28,362
I wasn't trying to copy
her by going to the cave.

188
00:17:28,540 --> 00:17:31,128
I would never cross
into the dark territory.

189
00:17:31,260 --> 00:17:36,180
But I thought by taking the same path
she did, I'd get closer to her, somehow.

190
00:17:38,480 --> 00:17:41,000
I wanted to go in as far as I could.

191
00:17:41,900 --> 00:17:42,800
In a way,

192
00:17:43,120 --> 00:17:45,497
I guess the whole point
of going there was to

193
00:17:45,580 --> 00:17:48,227
