never take her place.

194
00:17:48,760 --> 00:17:51,040
No, but you're still amazing.

195
00:17:51,580 --> 00:17:52,410
Me?

196
00:17:52,740 --> 00:17:56,681
What other girl here could walk
into that dark cave all by herself?

197
00:17:57,000 --> 00:17:59,680
I mean, that's something
only you could do.

198
00:18:00,160 --> 00:18:01,580
Only I could do?

199
00:18:02,040 --> 00:18:03,511
What do you mean by that?

200
00:18:04,120 --> 00:18:06,400
You're you, not Alice's replacement.

201
00:18:06,700 --> 00:18:09,260
And you got skills no one else here has.

202
00:18:10,180 --> 00:18:12,709
With a little practice,
you'll master them.

203
00:18:14,880 --> 00:18:17,040
May I have your attention, please?

204
00:18:17,820 --> 00:18:22,100
The greatest wish of Rulet's
founders has been fulfilled.

205
00:18:22,520 --> 00:18:24,960
The demon tree has been felled at last.

206
00:18:26,720 --> 00:18:31,340
So let us all give thanks
to Eugeo, son of Oryx.

207
00:18:33,060 --> 00:18:34,420
According to the law,

208
00:18:34,740 --> 00:18:36,677
when one finishes their calling,

209
00:18:36,760 --> 00:18:40,557
They have earned the right to choose
what their next calling will be.

210
00:18:40,640 --> 00:18:42,040
Go ahead, Eugeo.

211
00:18:42,440 --> 00:18:43,720
