212
00:19:04,140 --> 00:19:04,970
I…

213
00:19:07,820 --> 00:19:09,920
I will become a swordsman!

214
00:19:13,260 --> 00:19:17,440
I shall train hard and journey to Senator.

215
00:19:19,060 --> 00:19:22,480
You, Gio, what could you possibly...

216
00:19:26,620 --> 00:19:29,140
No, I won't question you.

217
00:19:30,300 --> 00:19:33,653
It is your church-given right
to choose your next column.

218
00:19:34,800 --> 00:19:40,800
As Rulet's elder, I approve Eugeo's
new calling, as swordsman! Yeah!

219
00:19:52,540 --> 00:19:53,370
Selka.

220
00:19:55,940 --> 00:19:56,770
Eugeo.

221
00:19:57,300 --> 00:20:00,500
Before I go, I wanted
to tell you something.

222
00:20:01,120 --> 00:20:01,950
Oh?

223
00:20:02,033 --> 00:20:02,863
What is it?

224
00:20:03,440 --> 00:20:08,280
My goal is to go to Senator
and bring Alice back here.

225
00:20:08,600 --> 00:20:09,880
I thought so.

226
00:20:10,700 --> 00:20:14,120
For the past six years, it's
all I've been thinking about.

227
00:20:14,520 --> 00:20:18,980
But with my calling, I had
no idea how I'd go about it.

228
00:20:20,520 --> 00:20:22,720
Then Kirito suddenly showed up,

229
00:20:22,820 --> 00:20:25,777
and bringing Alice back
didn't seem hopeless anymore.

230
00:20:25,860 --> 00:20:29,566
For some reason, I feel like I
can do anything with him around.

231
00:20:30,080 --> 00:20:32,680
You and your family have suffered so much.

232
00:20:33,120 --> 00:20:34,355
All on account of me.

233
00:20:35,060 --> 00:20:38,360
So, I'll bring Alice back
and make things right.

234
00:20:40,180 --> 00:20:43,140
Have faith in me, and wait for our return.

235
00:20:44,480 --> 00:20:48,600
Well, I can't stop you,
but if you insist... I do.

236
00:20:51,680 --> 00:20:53,460
Okay, I shall wait.

237
00:20:55,900 --> 00:20:58,380
Just make sure the three of you come back.

238
00:21:01,720 --> 00:21:04,557
I'll make sure we all
come back safe, promise.

239
00:21:04,640 --> 00:21:05,960
Good luck!

240
00:21:13,840 --> 00:21:15,417
Sorry to keep you waiting.

241
00:21:15,500 --> 00:21:16,760
No worries.

242
00:21:19,120 --> 00:21:21,060
Well then, are you ready?

243
00:21:21,660 --> 00:21:22,490
Uh-huh

244
00:21:24,080 --> 00:21:26,117
I wonder what Central will be like?

245
00:21:26,200 --> 00:21:27,500
Who knows?

246
00:21:34,440 --> 00:21:37,200
It's gotta be way bigger
than Rulid, right?

247
00:21:38,740 --> 00:21:40,340
I certainly hope so.

248
00:21:45,240 --> 00:21:47,197
It looks like rain's coming.

249
00:21:47,280 --> 00:21:49,980
We should hurry before
we get caught in it!

250
00:21:53,200 --> 00:21:54,040
What's wrong?

251
00:21:54,780 --> 00:21:55,610
Huh, what?

252
00:21:55,693 --> 00:21:57,540
Never mind. Shall we go?

253
00:21:58,800 --> 00:21:59,630
Yeah.

254
00:22:33,640 --> 00:22:37,960
I love you, I love you

255
00:23:06,380 --> 00:23:09,180
Thank you.

256
00:23:36,020 --> 00:23:38,260
Next time, Ocean Turtle.
